=== Technical Question ===
Question: I get this error in my php code: "Call to undefined method App\Controller\UserController::getName()" - this is my line of code: $user->getName() where $user is an instance of User entity.

Answer: The error "Call to undefined method App\Controller\UserController::getName()" indicates that PHP is trying to call the `getName()` method on your `UserController` class instead of an instance of the `User` entity.

